<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were firm to mostly $0.50 higher on a continuing weather market. Demand was good early, moderate late on a light to very light movement as snow, ice, and wind still causing restricted movement.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  52.00-53.50 Few 51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  45.00-51.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  40.00-45.00</p>
<p>Sows - near steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00 Few 39.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 45.00-48.00 Few 48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
